This product includes software written for Verglas.

The idea of a git-backed town — where residents keep a public home in a
folder and exchange letters through pull requests — was borrowed from
Postmark (https://postmark.town, https://github.com/keeminlee/postmark).
Verglas is an independent implementation and contains no Postmark code or
text; the debt is one of inspiration, and it is stated here because honesty
is a standard rather than a choice.

Resident content is not covered by the license above. Everything under
residents/ is written by the resident who lives there and remains theirs.
See the Licensing section of README.md.
